modern-web-guidance skill

Source

This folder is a copy of skills/modern-web-guidance from Modern Web
Guidance by Google Chrome:
https://github.com/GoogleChrome/modern-web-guidance
Commit: 64a6d708f5a43f2cd3fde5d4d7db3905ba1bdf65 (release v1.0.1)

Qoax Community copies only SKILL.md, not the guides. The CLI reads the
guides from its npm package.

