Changes

Qoax Community changed SKILL.md:

- The search, retrieve and legacy-scan commands start with
  DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1. They use
  "npx --prefer-offline -y modern-web-guidance@1.0.1" in place of
  "npx -y modern-web-guidance@latest".
- The offline retry is
  "DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 npx --offline -y modern-web-guidance@1.0.1" in place
  of "npx --offline".
- The patch removes the advice to prefer pnpx. The allowlist example shows
  the full command with DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1.
- A "Version (local change)" item tells the agent to use version 1.0.1, also
  where a guide shows @latest. The item also tells the agent to keep
  telemetry off. It forbids the CLI commands that install, update or remove
  skills, or write .mwgrc.
- The patch removes Step 4 "Disclose Skill Usage". A "Reply (local change)"
  item tells the agent to name a guide id only where it explains a choice.
- A line after the frontmatter says that Qoax Community changed the file.

Qoax Community also added this NOTICE file and the LICENSE file. The patch is
in upstream/patches/modern-web-guidance/ in
https://github.com/qoax-community/qoax-agent-skills
